@ShipmentService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5068
@TenantId = 11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111
@UserId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### Create a shipment (auth required — dev identity via headers)
POST {{ShipmentService_HostAddress}}/v1/shipments
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-User-Id: {{UserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "TRK-1001",
  "carrierType": "Steadfast",
  "buyerEmail": "buyer@example.com",
  "destinationCity": "Dhaka"
}

### Get a shipment by id (tenant-scoped)
GET {{ShipmentService_HostAddress}}/v1/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-User-Id: {{UserId}}

### List shipments (paginated, tenant-scoped)
GET {{ShipmentService_HostAddress}}/v1/shipments?page=1&pageSize=10
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-User-Id: {{UserId}}

### Update shipment status
PUT {{ShipmentService_HostAddress}}/v1/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/status
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-User-Id: {{UserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newStatus": "InTransit",
  "description": "Departed sorting facility",
  "location": "Dhaka Hub"
}

### Cancel a shipment
DELETE {{ShipmentService_HostAddress}}/v1/shipments/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Tenant-Id: {{TenantId}}
X-User-Id: {{UserId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Customer requested cancellation"
}

### Public tracking (no auth)
GET {{ShipmentService_HostAddress}}/v1/track/TRK-1001

### Unauthenticated request — should return 401
POST {{ShipmentService_HostAddress}}/v1/shipments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trackingNumber": "TRK-UNAUTH",
  "carrierType": "Steadfast"
}
